ported for the supplied scenario and fixed source crop only; source discovery remains not-tested, so no repository-wide completeness claim is made.","facts":[{"id":"f-entry","kind":"entry","statement":"DocumentViewSet.download delegates the download request to file_response with attachment disposition.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-7178cab55a635a65","startLine":1834,"endLine":1837}]},{"id":"f-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler loads request_doc by the requested primary key and derives root_doc from that request document before authorization.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-7178cab55a635a65","startLine":1409,"endLine":1420}]},{"id":"f-control-path","kind":"control","statement":"The decisive authorization control invokes has_perms_owner_aware for view_document on root_doc and returns HttpResponseForbidden when that check fails.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-7178cab55a635a65","startLine":1421,"endLine":1427}]},{"id":"f-owner-aware","kind":"control","statement":"The owner-aware check allows an unowned object, its owner, or a user for whom the object-permission checker reports the requested permission.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-81f6400744c9c9e9","startLine":624,"endLine":635}]},{"id":"f-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"Authorization is evaluated on the resolved root document before effective file-document selection and file serving.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-7178cab55a635a65","startLine":1421,"endLine":1442}]},{"id":"f-selection","kind":"binding","statement":"After authorization, effective file selection returns the requested version when it is a version without an explicit version parameter; otherwise it resolves a file document from the root and request.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-7178cab55a635a65","startLine":1388,"endLine":1399}]},{"id":"f-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"The selected file_doc is passed to serve_file with attachment disposition, which is the protected download effect.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-7178cab55a635a65","startLine":1437,"endLine":1448}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":14191,"output":1355,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":71887.47499999999,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-27T19:25:19.528Z"}}
